OL,3,AGreen Party MP wants to make sure it is
OL,4,A'not vulnerable to extremists'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Green Party MP has said her party
OL,7,Fneeds to make sure it is not
OL,8,F"vulnerable to capture by extremists
OL,9,Fand racists" after members voted for a
OL,10,Fmotion that claimed Zionism was racism.
OL,12,FThe motion put forward by activists,
OL,13,Fwhich became formal policy after it was
OL,14,Fapproved at the Green's conference
OL,15,Fearlier this month, has divided senior
OL,16,Fparty figures and been criticised by
OL,17,FJewish groups.
OL,19,FWestminster leader Ellie Chowns told
OL,20,Fthe BBC it was a "significant and
OL,21,Fdamaging policy" and she would work to
OL,22,Freform the Green Party.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
